  "content": "Context: 12. LTC\n\n## 12. LTC  \nA Government servant under suspension cannot avail of LTC as he cannot get any leave including casual leave during the period of suspension. As he continues to be in service during the period of suspension, members of his family are entitled to LTC. - GJD (7), Chapter 4.",
